# CMDEDIT-SEL-13: metal1, a label and an instance selected: clockwise, 180, rotate -90, 90 -orig, 45, sideways, upsidedown (Q-CMDEDIT-61).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
load leaf
box 0 0 5 5
paint poly
save leaf
load a
box 10 10 30 20
paint metal1
box 15 15 15 15
label L
box 40 0 40 0
getcell leaf
box 0 0 60 30
select area
clockwise
box values
save r1
clockwise 180
box values
save r2
rotate -90
box values
save r3
clockwise 90 -orig
box values
save r4
clockwise 45
box values
save r5
sideways
box values
save r6
upsidedown
box values
save r7
